libewf
------------------------------------------
libewf is a library to access the Expert Witness Compression Format (EWF).

Runtime requirements:
  cygfuse-3.2.0-3
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libbfio1-20260623-1bl1
  libbz2_1-1.0.8-2
  libcdata1-20260703-1bl1
  libcdatetime1-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror1-20260703-1bl1
  libcfile1-20260704-1bl1
  libclocale1-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify1-20260703-1bl1
  libcpath1-20260703-1bl1
  libcsplit1-20260703-1bl1
  libcthreads1-20260703-1bl1
  libewf-devel-20260924-1bl1
  libewf3-20260924-1bl1
  libfcache1-20260520-1bl1
  libfdata1-20260521-1bl1
  libfdatetime1-20260521-1bl1
  libfvalue1-20260531-1bl1
  libhmac1-20260522-1bl1
  libodraw1-20240505-1bl2
  libsmdev1-20260902-1bl1
  libsmraw1-20260902-1bl1
  libuna1-20260602-1bl2
  libuuid1-2.40.2-2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  python312-3.12.12-1
  zlib0-1.4-1

