Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libewf

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libewf/archive/refs/tags/20260924.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libewf-20260924-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libewf-20260924-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libewf-20260924-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libewf-20260924-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libewf3-20260924-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libewf-devel-20260924-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libewf-20260924-X.tar.xz

